    "detailed_description": "<strong>BANISH</strong> is a Single Horror Game (for now). As a Priest, you are sent by the local church to a failed exorcism attempt in the Luxford Mansion. The Church Mission is about Mrs. Margaret Luxford who disappeared from social life after the unexplained suicide from her Husband.<br>Find out what happened with the Exorcism attempt, finish the Process, and try to stay alive if possible... <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1681727710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Banish her!</strong><br><br>New <strong>High Fidelity </strong>( AMD and Nvidia <strong>Performance for Ultra Graphics</strong> ) with low to middle Hardware requirements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/9bbdb8c424e420112aec51c814b45b22.poster.avif?t=1681727710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/9bbdb8c424e420112aec51c814b45b22.webm?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/9bbdb8c424e420112aec51c814b45b22.mp4?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to Banish?</h2></strong><br>- Enter the Mansion. But be careful the possessed Entity is around and Hunts you.<br>- Challenging gameplay<br>- Different states of Anger of the possessed Entity<br>- No two Rounds will be the same. Changing Behaviour from the Ghost and different Banish locations etc. are making every Round Different and need you to Plan your steps wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Banish the Entity</h2>-  The goal is to find and start the Ritual by finding Banish items and fulfilling Tasks which ends in a frightening Run against the Entity.<br>- Difficulty increases as you progress with the exorcism. If she gets angry...<br>- Hide in closets, help your friends by reviving them, and more<br>- The Entity can travel through broken Mirrors, her position is not predictable and will challenge you and your Group.<br>- Replayability<br>Different Ritual Places, different Locations of the Items, Different places where the Entity can find broken Mirrors, locked Doors, and more will make every round different.<br>- Fight back<br>Show her with a Hand Mirror her real Face, she won't like that... This will give you time to fulfill the Ritual.<br><br><br><br><strong>Difficulty Levels unlockable</strong><br>Play in Normal, Hard, and Nightmare Mode.<br>The Entity will change in appearance and Behavior.<br><br>Additional Notes:<br>AMD FIDELITY<br>Lobbies<br>Unreal Engine 5 ready<br>Steady Development, more Maps, and entities will come.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>BANISH</strong> is a Single Horror Game (for now). As a Priest, you are sent by the local church to a failed exorcism attempt in the Luxford Mansion. The Church Mission is about Mrs. Margaret Luxford who disappeared from social life after the unexplained suicide from her Husband.<br>Find out what happened with the Exorcism attempt, finish the Process, and try to stay alive if possible... <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1681727710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Banish her!</strong><br><br>New <strong>High Fidelity </strong>( AMD and Nvidia <strong>Performance for Ultra Graphics</strong> ) with low to middle Hardware requirements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/9bbdb8c424e420112aec51c814b45b22.poster.avif?t=1681727710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/9bbdb8c424e420112aec51c814b45b22.webm?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625820/extras/9bbdb8c424e420112aec51c814b45b22.mp4?t=1681727710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to Banish?</h2></strong><br>- Enter the Mansion. But be careful the possessed Entity is around and Hunts you.<br>- Challenging gameplay<br>- Different states of Anger of the possessed Entity<br>- No two Rounds will be the same. Changing Behaviour from the Ghost and different Banish locations etc. are making every Round Different and need you to Plan your steps wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Banish the Entity</h2>-  The goal is to find and start the Ritual by finding Banish items and fulfilling Tasks which ends in a frightening Run against the Entity.<br>- Difficulty increases as you progress with the exorcism. If she gets angry...<br>- Hide in closets, help your friends by reviving them, and more<br>- The Entity can travel through broken Mirrors, her position is not predictable and will challenge you and your Group.<br>- Replayability<br>Different Ritual Places, different Locations of the Items, Different places where the Entity can find broken Mirrors, locked Doors, and more will make every round different.<br>- Fight back<br>Show her with a Hand Mirror her real Face, she won't like that... This will give you time to fulfill the Ritual.<br><br><br><br><strong>Difficulty Levels unlockable</strong><br>Play in Normal, Hard, and Nightmare Mode.<br>The Entity will change in appearance and Behavior.<br><br>Additional Notes:<br>AMD FIDELITY<br>Lobbies<br>Unreal Engine 5 ready<br>Steady Development, more Maps, and entities will come.",
